## Confirmed Real APIs (already researched — reuse these)

### Roblox Engine (always real)
```lua
-- Movement / Character
Humanoid.WalkSpeed = n                          -- real Roblox property
Humanoid.JumpPower = n                          -- real Roblox property
Humanoid.UseJumpPower = true                    -- real Roblox property
HumanoidRootPart.CFrame = cf                    -- real, works in executors
LocalPlayer.CharacterAdded:Connect(fn)          -- real event
LocalPlayer.Character:FindFirstChildOfClass()   -- real method

-- Physics / Noclip
-- Source: github.com/Not-Kyle/Universal-Scripts.lua/Noclip.lua
RunService.Heartbeat:Connect(fn)                -- real
BasePart.CanCollide = false                      -- real property

-- Performance stats
-- Source: Roblox DevForum /t/pingfps-displayer/1670037
LocalPlayer:GetNetworkPing()                    -- real, returns seconds → *1000 for ms
RunService.RenderStepped:Connect(fn)            -- real, fires every render frame

-- Teleport
TeleportService:TeleportToPlaceInstance(PlaceId, jobId, LocalPlayer)  -- real
game.JobId                                       -- real, current server's unique ID
game.PlaceId                                     -- real

-- Server list API (public Roblox web API, works via game:HttpGet)
-- "https://games.roblox.com/v1/games/{PlaceId}/servers/Public?sortOrder=Asc&limit=100"
-- Returns: id(jobId), maxPlayers, playing, fps, ping, nextPageCursor

-- Time
Workspace:GetServerTimeNow()                    -- real
```

