## Movement Modes (all confirmed real)

| Mode | Real API | Source |
|------|----------|--------|
| GROUND | `Humanoid.WalkSpeed = n` + `CharacterAdded` repersist | AgentZer00 gist |
| PHANTOM | `Heartbeat` → `BasePart.CanCollide = false` | Not-Kyle + zxciaz noclip |
| TWEEN | `RenderStepped` lerp on `HumanoidRootPart.CFrame` | DevForum (avoids TweenService HRP breakage) |
| INSTANT | Direct `HRP.CFrame = cf` (3-frame hold) | poccwo.lua hopTo pattern |

**NOTE:** `TweenService:Create(HumanoidRootPart, ...)` directly **breaks physics** — never use it for player movement. Always use RenderStepped lerp instead.

