## Script Style Preferences

- No key system, ever
- Draggable GUI cards (compact, mobile-friendly)
- Chat bubble UI pattern for server hop type scripts
- Buttons: AUTO toggle, mode toggles, action buttons
- Live stats display: Ping, FPS, current action
- Generation guard pattern: `_G.__EggStealGen` + `_G.__EggStealKill`
- Module retry on boot (handle early executor injection)
- All HTML-escaped Lua operators (`\~=`, `..=`) must be replaced with real operators
- Comments explain the "why" not just the "what"
- File naming: SEA.LUA for Steal An Egg scripts, serverhopscript.lua for server hop

